# batman 1.13 - worked out by the app from the ports of TMNT Pro 1.58.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 38 of its 43 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 8 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Left outlane, Right outlane, Turntable lock 1, Turntable lock 2, Turntable lock 3.
# program sha1 4e11096f5e2d4ad24a5eb0fc9bee4722b2a06908, portgen revision 3, 1 reference port(s) of framework generation A.

game           batman
version        1.13

# ---- functions: site <name> <address> <first two instruction words> ----
#   tick: located (strict) [TMNT Pro 1.58]
site tick             0x003d3064 0xe92d4038 0xe3a00033
# site shot_dispatch          NOT PLACED: absent in the target (the function changed); no caller could be lined up; this build has no crule_manager
# site ball_end               NOT PLACED: absent in the target (the function changed); no caller could be lined up; this build has no crule_manager
